{"4050910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FLOOR 100", "steam_appid": 4050910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands of players leave notes to guide—or troll each other through a weekly dungeon to reach FLOOR 100. </strong><br><strong>A shorter, daily changing dungeon is also available!</strong>   <br><strong>Co-op or solo dungeon crawling, but work together as a community to reach FLOOR 100!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon to find the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read notes by thousands of players, or write your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid or fight off monsters with physics props.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover power-ups and modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New dungeon layout every day/week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach FLOOR 100 or die trying! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 floors with unique layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint every 10th floor (and new dungeon theme).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community notes should be used to guide direction and accelerate completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout changes weekly (and checkpoints are lost).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daily Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 floors with unique themes and layouts, no checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout changes daily. Learn from your mistakes today, or try fresh tomorrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to be completed in a day and without community notes (but are still optionally available).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldwide Community Notes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View notes by other players to help guide (or misguide) your direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write notes to guide or troll other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upvote or downvote notes by others, upvoted notes will show to more players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get healed when your note is upvoted.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thousands of players leave notes to guide—or troll each other through a weekly dungeon to reach FLOOR 100. </strong><br><strong>A shorter, daily changing dungeon is also available!</strong>   <br><strong>Co-op or solo dungeon crawling, but work together as a community to reach FLOOR 100!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon to find the next floor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read notes by thousands of players, or write your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid or fight off monsters with physics props.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover power-ups and modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New dungeon layout every day/week.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach FLOOR 100 or die trying! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 floors with unique layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoint every 10th floor (and new dungeon theme).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community notes should be used to guide direction and accelerate completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout changes weekly (and checkpoints are lost).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Daily Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 floors with unique themes and layouts, no checkpoints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout changes daily. Learn from your mistakes today, or try fresh tomorrow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to be completed in a day and without community notes (but are still optionally available).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldwide Community Notes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View notes by other players to help guide (or misguide) your direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write notes to guide or troll other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upvote or downvote notes by others, upvoted notes will show to more players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get healed when your note is upvoted.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Thousands of players leave notes to guide—or troll each other through a weekly dungeon to reach FLOOR 100. Play with up to 4 friends, but work together as a community to reach FLOOR 100! A shorter, daily changing dungeon is also available!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050910/1d41d8d9b1d846d782c03656f63c6f3198dbe0e7/header.jpg?t=1773169541", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050910/03ab69fe73a55bd662f46fe7e8ee7c7c42be0b98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773169541", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050910/03ab69fe73a55bd662f46fe7e8ee7c7c42be0b98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773169541", "website": "https://tbjbu2.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 @ 3.3 GHz or AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050-TI or AMD Radeon RX 